  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "681a3175f7ea0aaa",
      "translationZh": "在配备 RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell (Max-Q) 的 IGX Thor 上运行 Qwen3.8-27B",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b806859e9600cd82",
      "translationZh": "花了几个小时在一台 NVIDIA IGX Thor 上搭建自托管推理主机，却找不到这一硬件组合的任何性能数据，所以这里分享一下我的测试结果。所有数据都来自在这台实际机器上的运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3df07bae50351497",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA IGX Thor T7000 开发套件，aarch64，14 核 CPU，Ubuntu 24.04.4",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40afa07c15ece992",
      "translationZh": "RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell Max-Q Workstation，96GB，sm_120，300W 功耗上限",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a511d44490183c9",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA Thor，sm_110，与主机共享 122GB 统一 LPDDR5X 内存",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8bed2572dcc7c555",
      "translationZh": "SGLang 开发构建版本 5f55db35e，torch 2.13.0+cu130",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "09468f866d8beede",
      "translationZh": "Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B-FP8，27.8B 参数，混合 Gated DeltaNet 架构，262144 上下文长度",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "968490c9f60e5a7c",
      "translationZh": "在看数据之前，有一点需要说明：这张卡是300W的Max-Q版本，而不是600W版本。满功率版本的表现应该会更好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "72501f3a445c0fc5",
      "translationZh": "五种配置下的LLM吞吐量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ddf0d45615772411",
      "translationZh": "在单张GPU上使用sglang.bench_serving运行，ISL为8192，OSL为1024。通用参数为 --kv-cache-dtype fp8_e4m3 --mem-fraction-static 0.85 --attention-backend flashinfer 。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "654446996c76aded",
      "translationZh": "配置 conc 1 tok/s TPOT conc 16 tok/s TPOT TTFT @16 实际并发数 KV池",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d93139debaddfc99",
      "translationZh": "DFlash2 + fp32 + 惰性基数树",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "faf8dd3c3cb86f8b",
      "translationZh": "推测解码确实物有所值",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ce86a77a3f55491",
      "translationZh": "在批大小为1时，它带来了2.8倍的吞吐量：126.3 tok/s，对比44.7 tok/s，同时TPOT从21.3ms降至6.67ms。更令人惊讶的是并发数为16时的TTFT，从10530ms降至3161ms，降幅达3.3倍。在我的测试中，DFlash2在这两种情况下都胜过了EAGLE。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59d3f801ac831a38",
      "translationZh": "SSM状态的数据类型会让你吃苦头",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8cbd0d08c2368742",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8 是一个混合 Gated DeltaNet 模型，因此除了 KV 缓存之外，还有一个 GDN 状态池。配合 DFlash2 使用 fp32 运行这个池，会使草稿验证缓冲区膨胀到大约 25GB，随后服务器就会悄悄把并发请求数限制为 21，即使你要求的是 32。没有任何报错。它只是处理更少的请求，也不告诉你。把状态切换为 bf16 会让这个池的大小减半，恢复全部 32 个槽位，并让 KV 池的大小大致翻倍。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db4e4594f3b83151",
      "translationZh": "唯一能看出这一点的地方是启动日志中的 max_running_requests 那一行，所以每次更改配置后都要检查它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7447957184c3a48d",
      "translationZh": "bf16 状态没有造成任何我能测出的准确率损失",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce7799940f87f76e",
      "translationZh": "GSM8K，200 道题，temperature 为 0，通过聊天端点而非内置评估来评分：bf16 的准确率为 93.5%，fp32 为 94.0%。两者只差一道题，在 n=200 时完全处于噪声范围内。因此，bf16 速度更快，能容纳两倍的 KV，并达到完整的并发量，而我检测不到任何代价。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6ed149de2c594b5",
      "translationZh": "值得一提的是，SGLang 自带的 run_eval gsm8k 在我这里得分为 0.0。它调用 /v1/completions，不使用聊天模板，因此推理模型的输出始终无法匹配它的答案正则表达式。如果你看到零分，先检查评估框架，再责怪模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76a4b1e54dfab3e9",
      "translationZh": "推理模式占了首个 token 延迟的大部分",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a72e1ace18b93294",
      "translationZh": "简短的对话提示词，流式输出：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "56bc951cfafdc5a4",
      "translationZh": "模式 首个 token 首个内容 token",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4d7db6e6e45166c",
      "translationZh": "推理块会耗掉约 137ms，之后才会输出任何可供朗读的文本。如果你在做语音应用，就用 chat_template_kwargs: {\"enable_thinking\": false} 将其关闭，其他用途则保持开启。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "229fc81df871e58f",
      "translationZh": "我判断错的地方：运行小模型时，iGPU 比 RTX 更快",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bd375a829fc7e099",
      "translationZh": "我还在这台机器上运行流式 TTS（Chatterbox）和 STT（Nemotron 3.5 ASR，0.6B）。我原以为两者都应该放在 RTX 上，因为它的带宽约为 1.8 TB/s，而 Thor iGPU 的带宽约为 273 GB/s。我在每块 GPU 上都对两者做了基准测试：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40d1741f0bebd593",
      "translationZh": "GPU STT 批处理 RTFx STT 最终结果 @80ms STT 最终结果 @320ms TTS 首段音频 TTS 合成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "99d0bdb61a12c778",
      "translationZh": "RTX 的批处理吞吐量领先 23%，但在每一项延迟指标上都落后，其中在 320ms 的 STT 流式处理上落后 57%。这里有三个因素。批大小为 1 时，0.6B 模型受限于内核启动，而非带宽。RTX 还受到常驻 LLM 的 CUDA 上下文资源争用影响。而且，它是那个 300W 的部件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f21d7dd04cc8f223",
      "translationZh": "我现在是这样理解的：带宽需求随每个 token 搬运的权重数量而变化，而每次调用的开销大致固定。27B 模型每次前向传播要搬运约 28GB，所以它应该放在 RTX 上。批大小为 1 时，0.6B 模型搬运约 1.2GB 的数据，在一次耗时 50 到 100ms 的调用中，内存数据传输可能只占 4ms，因此带宽始终不会成为瓶颈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49ec47f6395ded70",
      "translationZh": "STT 以 1x 实时速度进行流式处理，接入关闭思考功能的 LLM，再接入 TTS。各项耗时从来电者说话结束时开始计量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d440a79ecfd01893",
      "translationZh": "并发通话数 STT 最终结果 LLM 首个 token 应答确认音频 完整回答",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c1c82d23afc2db5e",
      "translationZh": "在单台机器上，三个并发调用仍能在不到一秒内得到回答。第四个调用的响应时间则在 1.2s 左右。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3b9a418458386c2c",
      "translationZh": "那些让我踩坑的 aarch64 问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff7092c3a16028f5",
      "translationZh": "aarch64 上的 torch 2.10.0+cu130 有问题。在 sm_110 和 sm_120 上，所有 fp32 cuBLAS sgemm 都会失败并报 CUBLAS_STATUS_INVALID_VALUE，连最简单的 64x64 matmul 也不例外。这个问题只在模型推理的深层才会出现，所以看起来像是“这个模型不支持这块 GPU”，其实只是 wheel 包有问题。请将版本固定为 2.11.0。通用经验是：如果某个模型看起来不支持新架构，先运行一次普通的 matmul。这样一步就能区分到底是构建包出了问题，还是真的存在限制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19a87c10aa2325e0",
      "translationZh": "--gpus 在这里不起作用。Tegra 容器运行时以 CSV 模式运行，因此你需要改用 --runtime=nvidia -e NVIDIA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=<id>。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c871dd3e329f130",
      "translationZh": "Docker 启动时，NVIDIA 模块还没有加载。每个 GPU 容器在系统启动时尝试重启都会失败，并报“Driver Not Loaded”，而 Docker 不会对这类失败进行重试。断电之后，整个软件栈一直处于停机状态，docker.service 却照样报告状态正常。添加一个 systemd drop in 配置，让 Docker 启动前等待 nvidia-smi -L 成功执行，就能解决这个问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c04eb31749da38a",
      "translationZh": "如果有人想要具体数据，我很乐意运行其他配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c42166d84cbbd502",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/ahstanin 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
